        </div>
        <p class="card-title developers-text-body">Google's Accelerators</p>
        <p class="card-description developers-text-body">Fuel your innovation and leverage cutting-edge Google technology to solve real-world challenges.</p>
        <a href="https://developers.google.com/community/accelerators" class="developers-btn-blue">Learn more</a>
      </div>
      
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

      

